WEBVTT

00:05.380 --> 00:10.750
<b>The War Game between the Freya Familia and
the allied army is turning out to be pretty one-sided!</b>

00:11.250 --> 00:16.500
<b>The allies' biggest hitter, Rabbit's Foot, is
currently getting steamrolled by the King, Ottarl!</b>

00:45.040 --> 00:48.460
<b>There's just no stopping Orario's most powerful Familia!</b>

00:48.790 --> 00:51.210
<b>But jeez, I think they've made their point!</b>

00:51.500 --> 00:53.750
<b>Somebody stop his horror show!</b>

00:56.540 --> 00:57.540
<b>Oh, Bell...</b>

00:58.830 --> 00:59.880
<b>Master Bell...</b>

01:05.210 --> 01:10.250
<b>Kyou no story toki ni yo wa irony</b>

01:10.500 --> 01:14.380
<b>"Soredemo..." tte kokoro ni</b>

01:14.380 --> 01:19.960
<b>Mitsuke dashita bokura no sekai</b>

01:29.380 --> 01:34.830
<b>Ano hi kara koko ni iru motome tsuzuke sagashiteru</b>

01:35.080 --> 01:41.630
<b>Yowasa ni deau tabi ikutsumo ikutsumo koenakucha</b>

01:41.630 --> 01:45.670
<b>Sono tabi ni namida o koraete wa</b>

01:45.920 --> 01:50.710
<b>Tachiagatte asu asatte sou yattekita no sa</b>

01:50.880 --> 01:56.000
<b>Kore made o shinjite susunda sono saki de</b>

01:56.170 --> 02:00.960
<b>Kakegaenonai mono bokura o matsu</b>

02:01.170 --> 02:05.630
<b>Bouken no story hajimari wa kyou de ii</b>

02:05.920 --> 02:11.710
<b>Itamashii elegy dare mo utawanuyou ni</b>

02:12.080 --> 02:16.580
<b>Aa tsuyoku naritai hangeki no hajimari</b>

02:16.710 --> 02:20.130
<b>Kakkowarukute ii</b>

02:20.500 --> 02:26.250
<b>Aa deai ga ai soko ni itanda ne</b>

02:35.080 --> 02:39.170
<b>Astrea Record</b>

02:35.080 --> 02:39.170
<b>Inheritance</b>

02:40.830 --> 02:44.580
<b>Horn... I detest the way that you mirror me.</b>

02:52.040 --> 02:53.540
<b>Wrap this up already!</b>

02:53.540 --> 02:56.920
<b>Go and tell Hedin that he needs
to end the War Game now!</b>

02:58.250 --> 03:00.500
<b>Uh-oh!</b>

03:00.500 --> 03:01.830
<b>Here comes trouble!</b>

03:02.000 --> 03:04.500
<b>The Freya Familia goes on the offensive!</b>

03:05.880 --> 03:09.330
<b>A squadron led by Vana Freya is
now rushing towards the eastern side!</b>

03:09.750 --> 03:14.080
<b>They're invading the ruins
where the allies' Gods are hiding!</b>

03:14.420 --> 03:16.290
<b>You have to run for it, Lady Hestia!</b>

03:22.080 --> 03:23.250
<b>Okay, you got us!</b>

03:23.250 --> 03:24.880
<b>We surrender!</b>

03:25.500 --> 03:29.460
<b>We wanna side with Lady Freya! Comprende?</b>

03:30.330 --> 03:31.420
<b>Shut up.</b>

03:34.880 --> 03:37.880
<b>The Gods Magni and Modi are both out!</b>

03:38.170 --> 03:45.460
<b>Quickly followed by Ogma, Serket, and Sobek!
The allies' Gods are dropping like flies!</b>

03:46.080 --> 03:49.830
<b>Yikes! Looks like Soma has now been found, too!</b>

03:50.790 --> 03:55.960
<b>The Familia members of any God that has been knocked
out can no longer participate in the War Game.</b>

03:56.130 --> 03:59.250
<b>Which means the allied army has
just lost a huge chunk of their forces!</b>

03:59.500 --> 04:02.170
<b>Things were already looking bad,
but now they're even worse!</b>

04:03.330 --> 04:04.960
<b>Get out of here, Hestia!</b>

04:05.420 --> 04:07.290
<b>They'll find you sooner or later if you stay put!</b>

04:07.290 --> 04:09.750
<b>Go west! Head for the frontlines!</b>

04:10.290 --> 04:12.830
<b>We lose all chance of winning if they find you!</b>

04:13.330 --> 04:15.580
<b>Okay, but, what about you?!</b>

04:15.830 --> 04:17.330
<b>I'll act as a decoy!</b>

04:17.580 --> 04:20.290
<b>Now hurry and go,
while Takemikazuchi is still holding them off!</b>

04:25.500 --> 04:26.750
<b>You'll have to do better than that!</b>

04:28.290 --> 04:29.170
<b>Thanks!</b>

04:30.380 --> 04:31.540
<b>I found one!</b>

04:32.750 --> 04:34.130
<b>Everyone attack at once!</b>

04:42.830 --> 04:44.710
<b>You can't beat me with brute force!</b>

04:53.750 --> 04:56.460
<b>And down goes Goddess Hephaistos!</b>

04:56.630 --> 04:57.920
<b>Uh-oh!</b>

04:58.170 --> 05:01.290
<b>God Takemikazuchi has finally met his match, too!</b>

05:01.630 --> 05:04.830
<b>The Gods Dellingr and Ratri are also out.</b>

05:05.040 --> 05:08.670
<b>The power of Vana Freya and
the Einherjar is simply overwhelming!</b>

05:08.670 --> 05:10.210
<b>Not to mention their speed!</b>

05:10.540 --> 05:14.580
<b>Out of the 46 Familia that comprised the allied army,
there are now only four remaining!</b>

05:14.790 --> 05:19.500
<b>Defeat seems imminent if those four
Gods can't keep their flowers safe.</b>

05:19.920 --> 05:22.380
<b>The game will end!</b>

05:22.750 --> 05:25.920
<b>How are you gonna stay in this, allied army?!</b>

05:26.710 --> 05:28.290
<b>Just as expected.</b>

05:28.920 --> 05:33.040
<b>This was the natural conclusion when you consider
how much military superiority their side has.</b>

05:33.380 --> 05:36.540
<b>Which means there's no point in panicking just yet.</b>

05:36.920 --> 05:38.380
<b>The plan is in place.</b>

05:38.670 --> 05:40.290
<b>The preparations are done.</b>

05:40.920 --> 05:44.920
<b>All we need is one successful push to throw them
off balance, then the tables will turn!</b>

05:45.790 --> 05:49.000
<b>It's impossible for a nobody like me to compete
against the sharp mind of Master Hedin.</b>

05:49.290 --> 05:53.000
<b>So I have to consider his tactics,
fighting style, and thought patterns...</b>

05:53.420 --> 05:55.670
<b>and take advantage of whatever I can!</b>

05:59.290 --> 06:02.040
<b>Master Hedin is positioned awfully
close to their rearguard...</b>

06:03.460 --> 06:04.460
<b>Oh my gosh!</b>

06:05.330 --> 06:07.500
<b>Please hang in there, Lady Daphne!</b>

06:09.330 --> 06:10.460
<b>Daphne!</b>

06:10.960 --> 06:12.880
<b>Our victory is inevitable.</b>

06:13.170 --> 06:16.000
<b>Yet you resist. In a fruitless endeavor.</b>

06:17.630 --> 06:19.920
<b>Yeah, well, I'm not dead yet.</b>

06:20.630 --> 06:23.170
<b>Oh, Daphne...</b>

06:23.170 --> 06:24.540
<b>Cassandra! Heal me!</b>

06:25.380 --> 06:26.580
<b>Soul Light!</b>

06:31.750 --> 06:32.830
<b>I'm healing too slowly...</b>

06:33.500 --> 06:37.080
<b>That cursed weapon of yours... is really a pain in the ass.</b>

06:37.580 --> 06:41.830
<b>There is something peculiar about your body
and the way it's been weathering all my blows.</b>

06:42.750 --> 06:43.880
<b>Laurus Wreath.</b>

06:44.540 --> 06:46.380
<b>It's a skill that boosts my endurance.</b>

06:47.130 --> 06:50.250
<b>Although, I really hate using it since
it makes my skin all hard and woody.</b>

06:50.920 --> 06:53.210
<b>Just more grief that Lord Apollon caused me.</b>

06:55.460 --> 06:58.670
<b>Keep this up and you'll devolve into
a human-faced sapling that is bereft of speech.</b>

06:59.040 --> 07:01.630
<b>To what end do you brave
through such hell and brimstone?</b>

07:01.920 --> 07:03.040
<b>That's easy.</b>

07:03.710 --> 07:08.000
<b>My job is to buy as much time as possible by keeping
first-class adventurers like you busy.</b>

07:08.580 --> 07:11.250
<b>That's why I had everybody else
throw themselves at you.</b>

07:11.920 --> 07:13.920
<b>What good would I be if I didn't dig my heels in?!</b>

07:14.790 --> 07:16.080
<b>How foolhardy.</b>

07:16.500 --> 07:18.670
<b>Yet also worthy of my respect.</b>

07:19.000 --> 07:20.670
<b>Therefore... I shall end you!</b>

07:24.130 --> 07:25.580
<b>Oh no, Daphne!</b>

07:29.040 --> 07:32.170
<b>Cassandra... heal me again...</b>

07:32.170 --> 07:34.000
<b>Save your strength! I'll get right on it!</b>

07:34.000 --> 07:34.880
<b>Don't move.</b>

07:36.540 --> 07:41.000
<b>I will judge any attempt to cast magic
as further resistance and cut you both to pieces.</b>

07:41.290 --> 07:44.710
<b>Only if you lay down your weapons and
surrender will I allow you to heal her.</b>

07:46.710 --> 07:48.960
<b>Ignore him and heal me.</b>

07:49.380 --> 07:50.210
<b>Hurry.</b>

07:51.420 --> 07:52.670
<b>I shall wait 3 seconds.</b>

07:53.210 --> 07:55.290
<b>Three, two...</b>

07:55.420 --> 07:56.710
<b>We surrender!</b>

07:56.710 --> 07:59.630
<b>Please spare Daphne!</b>

08:01.130 --> 08:01.960
<b>You dummy.</b>

08:06.960 --> 08:09.500
<b>Now there are none left to oppose us here.</b>

08:09.790 --> 08:12.330
<b>This consumed more of my time than I had anticipated.</b>

08:12.920 --> 08:13.880
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

08:14.170 --> 08:16.130
<b>I wish I wasn't so useless.</b>

08:16.540 --> 08:19.290
<b>I couldn't do anything to change the course of fate.</b>

08:25.290 --> 08:26.250
<b>The wind...?</b>

08:28.130 --> 08:30.880
<b>But the wind will blow in our favor!</b>

08:48.790 --> 08:51.630
<b>"Please stop. I've had enough."</b>

08:52.250 --> 08:55.330
<b>How long has it been since I last pled for mercy like that?</b>

08:56.290 --> 08:57.420
<b>I can't win.</b>

08:58.130 --> 09:00.460
<b>It's impossible for me to beat Mr. Ottarl.</b>

09:01.330 --> 09:02.330
<b>But...</b>

09:03.040 --> 09:05.540
<b>Save me! Mr. Bell!</b>

09:07.290 --> 09:09.080
<b>I made a promise.</b>

09:09.880 --> 09:12.420
<b>A promise to save her.</b>

09:14.670 --> 09:16.630
<b>Unless I beat you...</b>

09:17.000 --> 09:20.000
<b>I can't reach Lady Freya.</b>

09:20.580 --> 09:21.580
<b>That's right.</b>

09:21.830 --> 09:24.960
<b>And I can't see Ms. Syr.</b>

09:24.960 --> 09:26.170
<b>That's right.</b>

09:30.290 --> 09:31.210
<b>Then...</b>

09:32.250 --> 09:33.420
<b>you're going down.</b>

09:37.000 --> 09:38.130
<b>Bring it on.</b>

09:38.920 --> 09:39.830
<b>Go crazy.</b>

09:50.500 --> 09:51.460
<b>It's blowing...</b>

09:59.130 --> 10:00.670
<b>The Gale Wind has come!</b>

10:01.920 --> 10:02.880
<b>Who goes there?</b>

10:03.630 --> 10:05.420
<b>I've come to join the fray.</b>

10:05.960 --> 10:08.250
<b>I hope you're prepared, brethren.</b>

10:08.960 --> 10:10.710
<b>Prepared for what, pray tell?</b>

10:11.830 --> 10:14.330
<b>To fall by my blade.</b>

10:14.710 --> 10:15.710
<b>Fat chance!</b>

10:37.420 --> 10:38.540
<b>H-holy smokes!</b>

10:38.790 --> 10:40.790
<b>Unbelievable! What's happening?!</b>

10:39.290 --> 10:40.920
<b>Who is this adventurer?!</b>

10:41.380 --> 10:43.170
<b>Guess they needed somebody to lean-on!</b>

10:43.170 --> 10:45.210
<b>Oh, come on. That joke's gone stale!</b>

10:45.790 --> 10:48.750
<b>No way, I thought the Gale Wind
was supposed to be dead!</b>

10:54.960 --> 10:56.750
<b>She's matching me blow for blow.</b>

10:57.080 --> 10:59.330
<b>This is nothing like back when
we fought at the Goddess Festival!</b>

11:05.670 --> 11:08.630
<b>You've gotten stronger! Level 6 strong!</b>

11:08.960 --> 11:11.330
<b>But there's no way you could have gone up 2 levels!</b>

11:11.880 --> 11:12.710
<b>It's possible!</b>

11:12.710 --> 11:14.170
<b>More than possible!</b>

11:14.500 --> 11:16.290
<b>Ryu has fought her fair share.</b>

11:16.710 --> 11:19.040
<b>Ever since the day that ended Orario's dark age!</b>

11:19.580 --> 11:23.000
<b>She has a long history of combat that's filled
with outstanding accomplishments!</b>

11:27.830 --> 11:32.380
<b>Five years ago, she was already
top tier among all the level 4s.</b>

11:33.000 --> 11:36.130
<b>It's hardly surprising she'd be
the first person to achieve a double rank up!</b>

11:37.250 --> 11:42.250
<b>I was powerless. I suffered miserable defeats
at the hands of both you and the King.</b>

11:44.040 --> 11:45.080
<b>So I had to change.</b>

11:45.500 --> 11:47.630
<b>I couldn't just let things stand as they were.</b>

11:49.250 --> 11:51.580
<b>Lady Astrea and everyone gifted me this...</b>

11:52.080 --> 11:53.790
<b>the Alvs Justitia.</b>

11:55.540 --> 11:57.080
<b>By using its sharp blade,</b>

11:57.460 --> 11:59.130
<b>I will claim victory this time!</b>

12:23.670 --> 12:24.960
<b>Surround that Elf, quickly!</b>

12:25.420 --> 12:26.500
<b>Einherjar!</b>

12:33.210 --> 12:36.380
<b>Heith! You would dare interfere in our duel?!</b>

12:36.630 --> 12:38.920
<b>Your pride is of no concern to me.</b>

12:39.580 --> 12:41.500
<b>Her Ladyship wants to have Bell.</b>

12:41.710 --> 12:45.580
<b>And our mission is to swiftly eliminate
any potential threats that could interfere.</b>

12:45.830 --> 12:46.920
<b>Am I wrong?!</b>

12:51.130 --> 12:54.500
<b>At times, single combat is not an option
where warriors must meet their end.</b>

12:54.920 --> 12:59.540
<b>Despite these regrettable circumstances,
there is naught we can do but curse the Fates.</b>

13:05.670 --> 13:08.080
<b>I'm going to use it, Lady Astrea.</b>

13:08.670 --> 13:11.250
<b>Put an end to her, Einherjar!</b>

13:13.670 --> 13:15.330
<b>Astrea Record.</b>

13:17.420 --> 13:20.420
<b>"With obligation fulfilled,
the scales are brought to balance."</b>

13:20.960 --> 13:23.040
<b>She's casting a spell! Don't let her finish!</b>

13:27.500 --> 13:29.000
<b>Wh-what the hell?!</b>

13:29.500 --> 13:32.880
<b>"Bastion of order, crown of rectitude,
light of vanquishment."</b>

13:33.330 --> 13:39.170
<b>"In the name of the Goddess, let traces of stars be jot
upon this land much like they rip through the Heavens."</b>

13:40.210 --> 13:42.130
<b>A barrier?! A star justitory?!</b>

13:51.710 --> 13:53.170
<b>"Justice is passed down."</b>

13:59.580 --> 14:01.250
<b>AGALLIS ARVESYNTH!</b>

14:12.040 --> 14:14.750
<b>A flame enchantment?! That's impossible!</b>

14:20.290 --> 14:21.250
<b>Alise...</b>

14:26.710 --> 14:28.130
<b>Scarlet Harnel!</b>

14:28.380 --> 14:30.290
<b>That magic belongs to Alise Lovell!</b>

14:30.750 --> 14:32.960
<b>Why the hell can you use it?!</b>

14:35.040 --> 14:36.460
<b>My journey ended.</b>

14:50.960 --> 14:53.330
<b>So I went to reunite with Lady Astrea,</b>

14:53.920 --> 14:56.460
<b>to inherit the spirit of Alise and everyone else.</b>

14:58.290 --> 15:00.580
<b>Here we go, Alise.</b>

15:14.380 --> 15:15.830
<b>Astrea Record.</b>

15:16.540 --> 15:21.710
<b>It's a type of magic unique to Ryu that allow her
to use the spells of her old comrades.</b>

15:22.420 --> 15:27.290
<b>With my ichor serving as a mediary,
she became the successor to Alise's brand of justice.</b>

15:28.040 --> 15:30.580
<b>Even if Ryu converted to another Familia,</b>

15:30.580 --> 15:33.170
<b>the bond she shares with those girls will never fade.</b>

15:33.960 --> 15:37.330
<b>The just course of action in her eyes
right now is stopping her friend.</b>

15:37.710 --> 15:43.040
<b>And considering that, I wish to illuminate her path
to the future with the light of the stars.</b>

15:44.000 --> 15:46.960
<b>What in tarnation? Is that summoning magic?</b>

15:46.960 --> 15:48.710
<b>Is she just like the Thousand Elf?!</b>

15:48.710 --> 15:51.210
<b>No, she hasn't summoned anything.</b>

15:51.880 --> 15:54.710
<b>This is a miracle of the Lower World
that goes beyond understanding.</b>

15:55.920 --> 15:57.630
<b>"Justice is passed down."</b>

15:58.130 --> 15:59.580
<b>"Astrea Record."</b>

15:59.920 --> 16:02.630
<b>In other words, these are the memories of the stars.</b>

16:05.250 --> 16:06.670
<b>The Astrea Familia.</b>

16:07.460 --> 16:11.170
<b>It's actually them. The Astrea Familia has returned!</b>

16:11.460 --> 16:12.460
<b>You can do it!</b>

16:18.420 --> 16:20.420
<b>"Now in the skies of the distant forest,"</b>

16:20.790 --> 16:23.500
<b>"to the infinite stars mounted
upon the eternal firmament of night."</b>

16:24.290 --> 16:25.500
<b>Concurrent chanting?!</b>

16:25.500 --> 16:26.330
<b>Stop her!</b>

16:26.920 --> 16:30.920
<b>"This fool doth entreat just once for
the divine protection of the stars' fire."</b>

16:32.920 --> 16:35.580
<b>"Grant thy benevolent light to
the one who abandoned thee!"</b>

16:35.830 --> 16:37.920
<b>Dammit, she's adept at spellcasting!</b>

16:38.880 --> 16:42.330
<b>"Come forth, wandering wind... my fellow drifter!"</b>

16:43.630 --> 16:46.040
<b>"Cross the skies, speed through the wastelands!"</b>

16:46.040 --> 16:48.500
<b>"Race more swiftly than any other!"</b>

16:53.080 --> 16:54.080
<b>Formidable.</b>

16:54.080 --> 16:56.000
<b>Unbelievable! What am I looking at?!</b>

16:56.540 --> 16:59.580
<b>"Let the light of stardust occupy me
and strike my enemy!"</b>

17:01.040 --> 17:02.670
<b>LUMINOUS WIND!</b>

17:06.380 --> 17:07.290
<b>Dodge it!</b>

17:11.130 --> 17:12.710
<b>Whose magic is that?!</b>

17:13.580 --> 17:15.710
<b>No way... it's Lady Ryu!</b>

17:16.460 --> 17:19.000
<b>Ryu. I knew you'd come.</b>

17:20.710 --> 17:21.670
<b>What the?</b>

17:22.250 --> 17:23.250
<b>An explosion?</b>

17:25.630 --> 17:26.750
<b>Ms. Ryu...?</b>

17:30.500 --> 17:32.420
<b>I'm the only one still standing.</b>

17:36.000 --> 17:38.790
<b>You amplified the scope of your spell
to make a wide-range attack.</b>

17:39.170 --> 17:43.130
<b>It expunged the interlopers and
cleared the battlefield of obstacles.</b>

17:43.580 --> 17:45.830
<b>Which leads me to surmise her true intent is...</b>

17:48.290 --> 17:49.000
<b>Bring it.</b>

17:49.670 --> 17:50.630
<b>You fool!</b>

17:59.540 --> 18:01.580
<b>Slow! Weak! Dull!</b>

18:02.460 --> 18:06.630
<b>That flame enchantment is most daunting,
but I already know how to counter it!</b>

18:07.130 --> 18:10.670
<b>Since the Gale Wind has not mastered
her control of the flames, my best chance is to...</b>

18:11.040 --> 18:11.830
<b>forge ahead!</b>

18:12.210 --> 18:14.540
<b>Go ahead and wear the flames of your friends like armor!</b>

18:14.710 --> 18:17.170
<b>It won't be enough to scorch my Victim Abyss!</b>

18:22.580 --> 18:25.880
<b>Just because you've suffered defeat twice
doesn't mean it can't happen thrice, you whelp!</b>

18:26.130 --> 18:28.920
<b>You still haven't even reached my feet!</b>

18:41.040 --> 18:42.960
<b>I'm being thwarted?! How is this happening?!</b>

18:46.670 --> 18:49.210
<b>No, it should be impossible for me to lose!</b>

18:49.580 --> 18:51.290
<b>Don't forget this is a War Game.</b>

18:51.580 --> 18:56.710
<b>Tell me, just how many adventurers did you cut down
with that blade before fighting against me?</b>

18:59.000 --> 19:00.500
<b>I need a favor, you guys.</b>

19:01.580 --> 19:02.580
<b>Go get beaten.</b>

19:03.170 --> 19:04.290
<b>Inconceivable!</b>

19:05.170 --> 19:10.750
<b>Cursed weapons can grant their user
with immense power, but it does come at a price.</b>

19:11.130 --> 19:15.290
<b>Primarily that means a drop in stats,
and high stamina consumption!</b>

19:16.420 --> 19:20.210
<b>All the fallen warriors here have
shaved your powers away!</b>

19:20.710 --> 19:23.420
<b>They forced you to waste as much
energy as they could!</b>

19:24.380 --> 19:25.460
<b>Ridiculous!</b>

19:26.460 --> 19:27.880
<b>It's coming together...</b>

19:28.540 --> 19:30.000
<b>It's all coming together!</b>

19:30.250 --> 19:33.170
<b>Lady Daphne, Lady Tsubaki, Master Ouka, everyone!</b>

19:33.460 --> 19:36.290
<b>All of the sacrifices they made
to keep fighting are paying off!</b>

19:41.170 --> 19:44.500
<b>I can't be sure who would win in a true one-on-one.</b>

19:45.250 --> 19:46.630
<b>But right now?</b>

19:47.580 --> 19:49.670
<b>This battle is OURS to win!</b>

19:51.040 --> 19:52.540
<b>Alise Lovell.</b>

19:53.330 --> 19:57.670
<b>Your flames of justice... were something I once admired...</b>

19:58.790 --> 20:00.500
<b>ARVELIA!</b>

20:12.500 --> 20:14.130
<b>That's one down!</b>

20:14.750 --> 20:17.790
<b>Dainsleif has been defeated!</b>

20:18.420 --> 20:20.960
<b>Hell yeah! Now that's more like it!</b>

20:21.670 --> 20:23.750
<b>They did it! They beat one!</b>

20:23.750 --> 20:25.880
<b>They wiped the floor with Dainsleif!</b>

20:26.080 --> 20:28.790
<b>Keep it up, Liliruca Arde!</b>

20:29.540 --> 20:31.460
<b>Howdya like that, suckers!</b>

20:31.460 --> 20:33.290
<b>This is huge! Yahoo!</b>

20:33.290 --> 20:35.500
<b>We took down a first-class adventurer!</b>

20:35.790 --> 20:38.540
<b>We're still this! Now the tables can be turned!</b>

20:38.920 --> 20:41.540
<b>First-class adventurers have
a huge impact on a War Game!</b>

20:41.880 --> 20:44.080
<b>Their forces should start to falter after losing one!</b>

20:44.080 --> 20:47.000
<b>Then the chain of command breaks down
and the battlefield turns into chaos!</b>

20:47.290 --> 20:49.750
<b>It's a crack in their armor! Our chance to win!</b>

20:50.790 --> 20:52.290
<b>They beat Lord Hogni?!</b>

20:52.630 --> 20:54.380
<b>What should we do now?!</b>

20:54.500 --> 20:55.710
<b>Stop panicking!</b>

20:56.710 --> 20:58.580
<b>We are the Andhrímnir.</b>

20:58.880 --> 21:02.710
<b>No matter how many of our people fall,
we simply heal their wounds, slap them awake,</b>

21:02.710 --> 21:05.630
<b>and send them straight back to the battlefield!</b>

21:05.830 --> 21:07.830
<b>Over and over! For as long as it takes!</b>

21:08.580 --> 21:10.710
<b>I will treat Lord Hogni myself.</b>

21:10.830 --> 21:13.040
<b>The rest of you revive the Einherjar!</b>

21:13.380 --> 21:14.170
<b>Yes ma'am!</b>

21:15.210 --> 21:17.580
<b>Damn you, allied army!</b>

21:17.960 --> 21:20.330
<b>But Lord Hogni is the only one you've managed to beat.</b>

21:20.630 --> 21:23.540
<b>And with our healing magic,
he'll be back on his feet in no time.</b>

21:24.170 --> 21:25.880
<b>I won't let you turn the tables on us.</b>

21:25.880 --> 21:27.580
<b>I will crush any hope you have.</b>

21:27.830 --> 21:29.710
<b>All for Lady Freya!</b>

21:30.040 --> 21:31.830
<b>Our victory is still assured!</b>

21:34.250 --> 21:35.000
<b>Huh?</b>

21:46.460 --> 21:47.250
<b>What?</b>

21:53.580 --> 21:56.130
<b>Fight evermore, my immortal lightning warriors.</b>

21:56.670 --> 21:58.040
<b>Caelus Hildr!</b>

22:19.000 --> 22:21.630
<b>Kono himitsu shizume</b>

22:21.630 --> 22:24.080
<b>Yuredasu suimen ni</b>

22:24.500 --> 22:28.670
<b>Kizuku yochi ga atta mitai</b>

22:29.460 --> 22:36.170
<b>Umaku arawasenai sore de ite masshiro na omoi</b>

22:36.170 --> 22:39.330
<b>Yobeba mata hoshiku naru</b>

22:39.330 --> 22:44.330
<b>Hayaru kanjou sore wa uneru nami no you</b>

22:44.710 --> 22:49.920
<b>Chikutto sotto shirazu ni hareteku</b>

22:51.000 --> 22:57.540
<b>Soshite hedateta kabe kuzurete rikai shita kotoba wa</b>

22:57.670 --> 23:02.000
<b>Tada yuratto sora ni ukanderu</b>

23:02.500 --> 23:08.040
<b>Tatoe kara demo koeteku ai hoshii</b>

23:08.290 --> 23:13.630
<b>Douse yume nara uso mo tsuredashite</b>

23:13.630 --> 23:17.290
<b>Tatoe ubaenai sei demo</b>

23:17.420 --> 23:22.880
<b>Kokoro o sukoshi mitashite kawaru</b>

23:23.170 --> 23:28.830
<b>Memai no you na muku na kasumi</b>

23:36.000 --> 23:40.960
<b>Next time</b>

23:36.000 --> 23:40.960
<b>Revenge</b>

23:36.000 --> 23:40.960
<b>Counterattack</b>

23:36.670 --> 23:38.750
<b>Next time: "Revenge".</b>
